                "markdown": "> url.Parse insufficiently validated the host/authority component and accepted some invalid URLs.\n\n|                                          |\n|Package         pkg:golang/stdlib@1.18.5  |\n|Affected range  <1.25.8                   |\n|Fixed version   1.25.8                    |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
